41349::$$$message_0278_0000_0000$$$::"You have wonderful fortune.[br]Please hold your head high and start your day with confidence."::
41350::$$$message_0278_0001_0000$$$::"And if you can, please share that happiness with someone close to you. You will become even more prosperous."::
41351::$$$message_0278_0002_0000$$$::"Well then, have a good day."::

